        "# File-like object\n",
        "\n",
        "A file-like object offers file-style operations such as `read()` or `write()`, even if it is not backed by a disk file. `io.StringIO` is one example.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-file-like-object)"
      ]
    }
